{"seq":3,"slug":"gnn-deployment-optimization","title":"GNN 部署与推理优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/engineering/gnn-deployment-optimization","wordCount":1227,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"gnn-部署与推理优化\">GNN 部署与推理优化</h1><p>从研究原型到生产系统，GNN 面临独特的部署挑战：不规则的图结构使得标准的模型优化技术（如量化、剪枝、编译）不能直接照搬；推理时需要访问邻域特征，引入额外的数据获取延迟；在线服务需要在毫秒级返回结果。本文覆盖从模型压缩到服务架构的完整部署链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GNN 推理与标准 DNN 推理的关键差异：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[GNN 推理的独特挑战] --&gt; B[图依赖]&#10;    A --&gt; C[不规则计算]&#10;    A --&gt; D[数据获取]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[推理一个节点需要其邻域]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[邻域大小不固定]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[scatter/gather 操作]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[无法做静态 batch]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[特征可能分布在远程]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[图结构需要实时查询]\">graph TD\n    A[GNN 推理的独特挑战] --&gt; B[图依赖]\n    A --&gt; C[不规则计算]\n    A --&gt; D[数据获取]\n    B --&gt; B1[推理一个节点需要其邻域]\n    B --&gt; B2[邻域大小不固定]\n    C --&gt; C1[scatter/gather 操作]\n    C --&gt; C2[无法做静态 batch]\n    D --&gt; D1[特征可能分布在远程]\n    D --&gt; D2[图结构需要实时查询]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>标准 DNN</th>\n<th>GNN</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入形状</td>\n<td>固定 (batch, seq, dim)</td>\n<td>不固定（每节点邻域大小不同）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算模式</td>\n<td>稠密矩阵乘法</td>\n<td>稀疏 scatter/gather</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据依赖</td>\n<td>只需自身输入</td>\n<td>需要邻域的特征和结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批处理</td>\n<td>自然对齐</td>\n<td>需要 padding 或动态 batch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译优化</td>\n<td>TorchScript/ONNX 成熟</td>\n<td>稀疏操作支持有限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模型压缩技术\">模型压缩技术</h2><h3 id=\"知识蒸馏\">知识蒸馏</h3><p>GNN 蒸馏的特殊之处在于需要同时蒸馏<strong>节点级知识</strong>和<strong>结构级知识</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>KL</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{distill} = \\alpha \\cdot \\text{KL}(p_T \\| p_S) + \\beta \\cdot \\|A_T - A_S\\|_F^2 + \\gamma \\cdot \\mathcal{L}_{task}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_T, p_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是教师/学生的预测分布，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_T, A_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是教师/学生的注意力矩阵。</p>\n<p><strong>GLNN</strong>（Graph-Less Neural Network）更激进——直接将 GNN 蒸馏为 MLP：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>KL</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = \\text{KL}(f_{GNN}(X, A) \\| f_{MLP}(X))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GN</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>推理时完全不需要图结构，只用节点自身特征输入 MLP。这在延迟极其敏感的场景（如广告 CTR 预估）中已被工业界广泛采用。代价是损失了图结构信息，适合图信号不强的场景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"量化\">量化</h3><p>GNN 量化面临两个特殊问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>聚合操作中的 scatter-add 在低精度下容易溢出</li>\n<li>注意力权重的 softmax 对量化误差敏感</li>\n</ol>\n<p>实践中的方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>推荐精度</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性变换 (W)</td>\n<td>INT8</td>\n<td>标准量化友好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注意力计算</td>\n<td>FP16</td>\n<td>softmax 需要精度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>scatter 聚合</td>\n<td>FP32 累加器</td>\n<td>防止溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终输出</td>\n<td>FP16</td>\n<td>下游任务可接受</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>PyG 支持通过 PyTorch 的动态量化 API 压缩线性层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch.quantization&#10;quantized_model = torch.quantization.quantize_dynamic(&#10;    model, {torch.nn.Linear}, dtype=torch.qint8&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.quantization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quantized_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.quantization.quantize_dynamic(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model, {torch.nn.Linear}, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.qint8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"剪枝与稀疏化\">剪枝与稀疏化</h3><p>图级别的剪枝有两个层面：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>参数剪枝</strong>：标准的权重剪枝，去除不重要的连接</li>\n<li><strong>图结构剪枝</strong>：去除对预测不重要的边，减少消息传递量</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>UGS（Unified GNN Sparsification）</strong> 同时学习权重掩码和图掩码：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>W</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⊙</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>⊙</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>W</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{m_W, m_A} \\mathcal{L}(f(X, A \\odot m_A; W \\odot m_W), Y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5861em;vertical-align:-0.8361em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8361em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊙</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊙</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实验表明，可以移除 50-80% 的边而精度下降 &lt;1%——这意味着推理时的 scatter 操作量减半。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编译与图优化\">编译与图优化</h2><p>PyG 2.3+ 的 <code>torch_geometric.compile()</code> 针对 GNN 的稀疏计算模式做了特殊优化：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[PyG 模型] --&gt; B[torch_geometric.compile]&#10;    B --&gt; C[禁用动态分发]&#10;    B --&gt; D[scatter 融合]&#10;    B --&gt; E[CSR 格式转换]&#10;    C --&gt; F[TorchInductor]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[优化后的 CUDA 内核]\">graph LR\n    A[PyG 模型] --&gt; B[torch_geometric.compile]\n    B --&gt; C[禁用动态分发]\n    B --&gt; D[scatter 融合]\n    B --&gt; E[CSR 格式转换]\n    C --&gt; F[TorchInductor]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[优化后的 CUDA 内核]</pre><p>关键优化点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>消除 Python 派发</strong>：MessagePassing 的动态分发在编译模式下静态化</li>\n<li><strong>scatter 内核融合</strong>：相邻的 scatter_add + 线性变换融合为单内核</li>\n<li><strong>内存布局</strong>：edge_index 从 COO 转为 CSR 格式，提升缓存命中率</li>\n<li><strong>动态 shape 支持</strong>：通过 <code>dynamic=True</code> 处理不同 batch 的图大小变化</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"在线服务架构\">在线服务架构</h2><p>生产环境中的 GNN 推理服务通常采用以下架构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[请求: 节点ID] --&gt; B[图存储服务]&#10;    B --&gt; C[邻域查询]&#10;    C --&gt; D[特征获取]&#10;    D --&gt; E[GNN 推理引擎]&#10;    E --&gt; F[返回嵌入/预测]&#10;    G[离线管线] --&gt; H[嵌入预计算]&#10;    H --&gt; I[嵌入缓存]&#10;    A --&gt; J{缓存命中?}&#10;    J --&gt;|是| K[直接返回缓存嵌入]&#10;    J --&gt;|否| B\">graph TD\n    A[请求: 节点ID] --&gt; B[图存储服务]\n    B --&gt; C[邻域查询]\n    C --&gt; D[特征获取]\n    D --&gt; E[GNN 推理引擎]\n    E --&gt; F[返回嵌入/预测]\n    G[离线管线] --&gt; H[嵌入预计算]\n    H --&gt; I[嵌入缓存]\n    A --&gt; J{缓存命中?}\n    J --&gt;|是| K[直接返回缓存嵌入]\n    J --&gt;|否| B</pre><p><strong>关键设计决策</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策点</th>\n<th>选项 A</th>\n<th>选项 B</th>\n<th>取舍</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>嵌入计算时机</td>\n<td>实时计算</td>\n<td>离线预计算</td>\n<td>实时性 vs 延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邻域深度</td>\n<td>1-hop 实时</td>\n<td>2-hop 预计算</td>\n<td>精度 vs 速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存策略</td>\n<td>全量缓存</td>\n<td>LRU 热点缓存</td>\n<td>内存 vs 命中率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新频率</td>\n<td>事件驱动增量</td>\n<td>定时全量重算</td>\n<td>实时性 vs 吞吐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"增量推理\">增量推理</h2><p>对于动态图（如社交网络、交易图），每次新事件到来不需要重新计算全图：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>局部重计算</strong>：只更新受影响节点（变化节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>-hop 邻域）的嵌入</li>\n<li><strong>嵌入追加</strong>：新节点直接基于已有邻域嵌入计算自己的表示</li>\n<li><strong>延迟批量更新</strong>：累积一段时间的变化后一次性更新</li>\n</ol>\n<p>GNN 的局部性使得增量推理天然可行——节点嵌入只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>-hop 邻域，图的其他部分不变则嵌入不变。这是 GNN 相比全图方法（如 Transformer）在动态场景中的天然优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GNN 部署面临图依赖、不规则计算、数据获取三重挑战</li>\n<li>GLNN 蒸馏将 GNN 压缩为 MLP，牺牲图信号换取极致延迟</li>\n<li>混合精度策略需要对不同组件（线性层、注意力、聚合）分别配置</li>\n<li>图结构剪枝（UGS）可移除 50-80% 的边而精度几乎不损</li>\n<li><code>torch_geometric.compile()</code> 通过 scatter 融合和 CSR 转换加速推理</li>\n<li>工业部署常采用预计算缓存 + 增量更新的混合策略</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章节：<a href=\"scalable-gnn-training\">大规模 GNN 训练</a>中的采样策略在推理时同样适用于控制计算量</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../../ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations/experimentation-platform\">A/B 测试 - 实验平台</a>讨论了在线模型部署的实验框架——GNN 模型的上线同样需要灰度和 A/B 测试验证</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GNN 部署与推理优化","id":"gnn-部署与推理优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模型压缩技术","id":"模型压缩技术"},{"level":3,"text":"知识蒸馏","id":"知识蒸馏"},{"level":3,"text":"量化","id":"量化"},{"level":3,"text":"剪枝与稀疏化","id":"剪枝与稀疏化"},{"level":2,"text":"编译与图优化","id":"编译与图优化"},{"level":2,"text":"在线服务架构","id":"在线服务架构"},{"level":2,"text":"增量推理","id":"增量推理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"大规模图神经网络训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/engineering/scalable-gnn-training"},"next":null}